 171: ## T17 — @mention composition and rendering
 172: Reasoning: The user-facing mention flow on top of T4, for both queued text and unqueued attachment/voice sends.
 173: Task: Typing "@" opens an accessible combobox/listbox of the conversation's current members (T4 roster) except 
the user, filtered while typing, operable by arrows/Enter/Tab/Esc and mouse; choosing inserts a highlighted mention 
whose user ID travels with the send — in the outbox item for text and in the create request for attachment/voice 
messages (including their Phase 4 retry); unselected "@name" text is plain; mentions render distinctly for everyone 
and the mentioned viewer sees the whole message highlighted with a non-color cue; a stale poll never drops a mention 
delivered by Realtime.
