 180: ## T18 — Mention desktop notifications
 181: Reasoning: Extends the Phase 4 notification claim with mention eligibility, emission-time authorization, and 
browser-wide suppression.
 182: Task: With the Phase 4 toggle on and permission granted, a mentioned user gets one notification per message (DM, 
group, room, thread reply) titled "<Autor> mencionou você em <conversa>" with the full text, opening the conversation 
on click; emission is authorized with authoritative data under the current identity, then re-checked without further 
awaits for same signed-in user and no received removal signal; account switch or sign-out discards pending 
notifications; no tab notifies while any of the user's tabs in the browser is visible on that conversation; DM/group 
messages are never notified twice; an unchanged replay after a mentioned recipient left notifies no removed recipient.
