153:## T15 — Reliable named members-only typing indicator
154-Reasoning: Client side of G4 on the T5 topic, with its own application-level recovery and removal detection.
155-Task: Typing travels on the T5 private topic with payload limited to user identity and typing flag; the indicator 
stays visible during continuous typing and disappears ≤ 5 s after stop, blur, send, conversation switch, or tab close; 
names follow FR-018 in direct, group, and room conversations; the user's own sessions never show their typing; the 
typing stream has application-level recovery after error, timeout, or terminal closure with capped exponential backoff 
and exposes its health; the app detects its own removal from a conversation through a signal independent of 
conversation access and leaves the topic within 5 s.
