 215: 
 216: - D1 (finding 3): "10s até 10 msgs" — with ≤ 10 pending and create quota available, delivery within 10 s; above 
that,
 217:   delivery continues automatically within the limit; a replay that returns an already-stored message no longer
 218:   consumes the create quota.
 219: - D2 (finding 4): "Fila sobrevive" — reloading offline shows the normal browser error; when the page loads again 
the
 220:   pending messages appear and are sent. No service worker / offline app shell.
 221: - D3 (finding 7): "Aceitar até ~1h" — non-members never join; a removed member is taken off the channel by the 
app
 222:   immediately; a tampered client may still receive only the typing signal until its access token expires (~1 h).
 223:   Accepted residual risk.
 224: - D4 (findings 16, 19, 15): selected "Sem auto-menção" (self not in the @ list, not recorded). Note: "faça o que
 225:   considera as melhores praticas" — owner delegated the remaining small points: copy is proposed, equivalent
 226:   Portuguese allowed; "ao vivo" across devices = within 5 s (orchestrator choice under this delegation).
 227: 
 264: 
 265: - D5 (r4 #1): "Bloquear envio" — if the outbox cannot be written (site storage blocked), nothing is dispatched; 
the text
 266:   stays in the composer with "Este navegador não permite guardar mensagens; libere o armazenamento do site". 
Replaces
 267:   v3's degraded send mode.
 268: - D6 (r4 #3, #5): "Aceito os dois" — accepted residual risks: (1) a removal racing the final pre-display check 
may still
 269:   let one last mention notification show; (2) a tampered client of a removed member may also SEND fake typing 
signals
 270:   until its access token expires (~1 h), extending D3. The normal app re-checks right before display and leaves 
the
 271:   typing topic within 5 s of a removal.
